<title>HONG KONG: Star Telecom interim net down 93.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Star Telecom interim net down 93.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	0.72	 vs 10.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) nil	  vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     68.55 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 3.39	 vs 50.66</p>
<p>    Turnover		  293.67     vs 362.51</p>
<p>    Company name	    Star Telecom International Holding Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Telecommunications operator Star Telecom was previously known as Star Paging (International Holding) Ltd.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of leasehold properties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
